      "analysis": "The workload is descriptive statistics over transposed, column-contiguous doubles. Likely opportunities are replacing O(columns*rows^2) bubble sorting, linearizing mode after sorting, reducing passes/I/O, and conditional 4-core column parallelism. Exact observable behavior matters more than intended prose because formatted one-decimal output and floating-point accumulation order can expose changes. The only measurement is a correct 9.844 ms baseline, so fixed process/thread overhead may dominate and every integration requires direct measurement."
